# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `make asan-ut-nextest`. Each entry names the
# leaked allocation's frame and says why the leak is intended.

# The test pins each cache manager with `mem::forget(entry.pin())` so `gc` sees it in use.
leak:test_forget_drops_only_that_configs_managers_even_in_use

# The test forgets its TempDir because the detached server thread keeps serving from it.
leak:grpc_transport_round_trips_a_real_client_over_compio
